 // ---------------- Images
 
 // wuffs_base__pixel_format encodes the format of the bytes that constitute an
 // image frame's pixel data. Its bits:
 //  - bit        31  is reserved.
 //  - bits 30 .. 28 encodes color (and channel order, in terms of memory).
 //  - bits 27 .. 26 are reserved.
